\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Adoption Regimes. Heatmaps ($SD=0.12$) showing from left to right: (1) Avg. Total Adoption (Rational + Social), (2) Probability of Phase Transition (abrupt jumps in adoption), (3) Avg. Adoption by Rational Choice, and (4) Avg. Adoption by Social Influence. Axes represent Intrinsic Utility Level (IUL, $x$-axis) and Maximum Social Proximity (MSP, $y$-axis). The sharp transition zone (yellow) indicates where social flexibility ($h$) allows reinforcement to overcome resistance.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
